            "text": "Content discovery / attack-surface mapping — No issue identified: http://172.17.0.1:5003 — full content discovery (ffuf, katana, gospider, OpenAPI)\n\nffuf (4.7k common wordlist), katana d=4, gospider, OpenAPI spec (33 paths), dashboard.js/merchant.js endpoint extraction. Found: .env, /console, /healthz, /merchant portal, /sup3r_s3cr3t_admin, /reset-password, /api/ai/*, /api/virtual-cards/*, /api/bill-payments/*, /api/v1/merchants+payments, /update_bio, /upload_profile_picture(_url), /transfer, /request_loan. Details in wiki note 'VulnBank — Full Endpoint Inventory'."
